MEDIAN - the median of a numeric array, passed by name.

Language features
  - SEED_EXPORT; reading a BASIC array by its name
  - malloc / free for a sorted scratch copy (the seed heap)

Try it
  DIM A(5) : A(0)=3:A(1)=1:A(2)=4:A(3)=1:A(4)=5:A(5)=9
    SEED h%, "MEDIAN.SED" : PRINT CALL(h%, "A")

Build it on the machine
  grow median          # -> build/MEDIAN.SED
  (grow links the berry-libc from SEEDCORE.PKT for this one automatically)
It is also prebuilt in /SEED as MEDIAN.SED, ready to use.

